    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then he brought me to the nave, and measured the jambs; on each side six cubits was the breadth of the jambs.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41.1",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Compare Gk: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "tent",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the breadth of the entrance was ten cubits; and the sidewalls of the entrance were five cubits on either side; and he measured the length of the nave forty cubits, and its breadth, twenty cubits. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then he went into the inner room and measured the jambs of the entrance, two cubits; and the breadth of the entrance, six cubits; and the sidewalls",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41.3",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Gk: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "breadth",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " of the entrance, seven cubits. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he measured the length of the room, twenty cubits, and its breadth, twenty cubits, beyond the nave. And he said to me, “This is the most holy place.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then he measured the wall of the temple, six cubits thick; and the breadth of the side chambers, four cubits, round about the temple. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the side chambers were in three stories, one over another, thirty in each story. There were offsets",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41.6",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Gk Compare 1 Kings 6.6: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "they entered",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " all around the wall of the temple to serve as supports for the side chambers, so that they should not be supported by the wall of the temple. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the side chambers became broader as they rose",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41.7",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Cn: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "it was surrounded",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " from story to story, corresponding to the enlargement of the offset",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41.7",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Gk: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "for the encompassing of the temple",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " from story to story round about the temple; on the side of the temple a stairway led upward, and thus one went up from the lowest story to the top story through the middle story. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I saw also that the temple had a raised platform round about; the foundations of the side chambers measured a full reed of six long cubits. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The thickness of the outer wall of the side chambers was five cubits; and the part of the platform which was left free was five cubits.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41.9",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Syr: Heb lacks",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "five cubits",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Between the platform",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41.9",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Cn: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "house of the side chambers",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " of the temple and the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "chambers of the court was a breadth of twenty cubits round about the temple on every side. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the doors of the side chambers opened on the part of the platform that was left free, one door toward the north, and another door toward the south; and the breadth of the part that was left free was five cubits round about.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The building that was facing the temple yard on the west side was seventy cubits broad; and the wall of the building was five cubits thick round about, and its length ninety cubits.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then he measured the temple, a hundred cubits long; and the yard and the building with its walls, a hundred cubits long; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "also the breadth of the east front of the temple and the yard, a hundred cubits.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then he measured the length of the building facing the yard which was at the west and its walls",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41.15",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Cn: The meaning of the Hebrew term is unknown",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " on either side, a hundred cubits.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The nave of the temple and the inner room and the outer",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41.15",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Gk: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "of the court",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " vestibule ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "were paneled",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41.16",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Gk: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "the thresholds",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " and round about all three had windows with recessed",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41.16",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Cn Compare Gk 1 Kings 6.4: The meaning of the Hebrew term is unknown",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " frames. Over against the threshold the temple was paneled with wood round about, from the floor up to the windows (now the windows were covered), ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to the space above the door, even to the inner room, and on the outside. And on all the walls round about in the inner room and the nave were carved likenesses",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41.17",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Cn: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "measures and carved",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of cherubim and palm trees, a palm tree between cherub and cherub. Every cherub had two faces: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
